invalid type: string "Document: Hotel Policies, Terms & Guest Conduct Regulations\nSection: 3. Pet Policy (Canine Concierge Program)\n\n- Pet-Friendly Rooms: Dogs up to 45 lbs (20 kg) are welcomed exclusively in Deluxe Double Queen Garden Terrace rooms and Cliffside Ocean Villas.\n- Maximum: 2 dogs per accommodation.\n- Sanitization Fee: $150 non-refundable one-time fee per stay.\ntion Chamber\nÿÿ